WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:02.877 --> 00:00:06.840
<i>It appeared as if humanity will soon
be destroyed by the demons.</i>

2
00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:15.181
<i>But there was a mage who fought alone
and saved everyone.</i>

3
00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:27.277
<i>He was called the Magic Emperor
and became a legend.</i>

4
00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.658
You see...

5
00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:37.120
even a commoner can win too.

6
00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:40.749
Can you see how powerful we can be?

7
00:00:43.042 --> 00:00:44.169
Asta!

8
00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:47.797
What a ridiculous guy.

9
00:00:50.925 --> 00:00:53.803
So you are finally awake. you jerk?

10
00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:57.015
Has my magic been sealed off?

11
00:00:57.140 --> 00:01:00.852
When we get back to Magic Knights.
I want you to spill it all out.

12
00:01:00.977 --> 00:01:04.814
Who are you and what's your motive?

13
00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:06.024
I refuse.

14
00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:08.610
It looks like the end is here.

15
00:01:11.029 --> 00:01:13.907
Ice Magic. Ice Funeral.

16
00:01:20.663 --> 00:01:22.791
Where does his determination come from?

17
00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:26.377
What an asshole!

18
00:01:27.295 --> 00:01:28.546
Life...

19
00:01:29.297 --> 00:01:31.883
What does he take life for?

20
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:39.074
Do you want subtitles for any video?
-=[ ai.OpenSubtitles.com ]=-

21
00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:10.023
You guys are so screwed.

22
00:03:12.984 --> 00:03:14.861
<i>Why does he seem so happy?</i>

23
00:03:14.986 --> 00:03:16.863
<i>Someone just died.</i>

24
00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:20.033
Captain. this isn't the time to laugh.

25
00:03:20.742 --> 00:03:22.118
Even if we're upset.

26
00:03:22.201 --> 00:03:24.329
Mr. Seihi wouldn't come back alive.

27
00:03:24.412 --> 00:03:25.246
Right?

28
00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:27.665
Yes. Yami is right!

29
00:03:28.291 --> 00:03:31.294
Mr. Seihi has always loved
a lively environment.

30
00:03:31.419 --> 00:03:33.796
Come on! Laugh!

31
00:03:36.299 --> 00:03:37.383
Laugh!

32
00:03:39.135 --> 00:03:40.762
Louder!

33
00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.182
You too. Noelle!

34
00:03:52.106 --> 00:03:53.441
This is great.

35
00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:57.445
What happened to Mr. Seihi
was a real shame.

36
00:03:57.987 --> 00:04:00.323
but all of you managed
to protect the villagers.

37
00:04:02.283 --> 00:04:03.701
Be proud of yourselves.

38
00:04:06.663 --> 00:04:10.416
All of you did well.
and I thank you for that. you fools.

39
00:04:10.875 --> 00:04:12.210
-Yes!
-Yes!

40
00:04:12.543 --> 00:04:13.795
Thank you.

41
00:04:17.048 --> 00:04:18.466
What's with that hand gesture?

42
00:04:18.591 --> 00:04:19.717
You fool!

43
00:04:19.842 --> 00:04:22.553
Don't you even know
the salute of the Magic Knights?

44
00:04:22.679 --> 00:04:24.222
Take a good look!

45
00:04:24.472 --> 00:04:27.475
These fingers represent the clover.

46
00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.185
Come on! Try it!

47
00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:30.395
Yes!

48
00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:32.188
You sure are a quick learner!

49
00:04:35.441 --> 00:04:36.859
I'm back!

50
00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:41.406
Thank you for your hard work.

51
00:04:42.073 --> 00:04:44.367
Vanessa! Finral!

52
00:04:44.617 --> 00:04:47.912
Yami. we've been
to the Magic Investigation Department.

53
00:04:48.037 --> 00:04:50.665
I see. Did you find out anything?

54
00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.417
Where did those people come from?

55
00:04:52.542 --> 00:04:54.669
We must find their base
and teach them a good lesson!

56
00:04:54.794 --> 00:04:57.588
We need to take care
of that jerk who got away too.

57
00:04:57.714 --> 00:04:59.465
About that...

58
00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:04.512
<i>The Investigation Department identified
the item left behind by the perpetrator.</i>

59
00:05:05.138 --> 00:05:06.889
But there's still no clue yet.

60
00:05:07.015 --> 00:05:09.517
The Investigation Department
is so useless.

61
00:05:12.228 --> 00:05:13.479
Hey. you!

62
00:05:13.896 --> 00:05:18.359
Don't break anything!

63
00:05:19.235 --> 00:05:20.445
So sorry.

64
00:05:21.946 --> 00:05:25.491
But that pocket watch
looks quite precious. right?

65
00:05:25.616 --> 00:05:30.455
Yes. and judging from your statement
about their words and deeds.

66
00:05:30.872 --> 00:05:32.957
they seem to be of high status.

67
00:05:33.499 --> 00:05:36.294
So. they are either royals or nobles?

68
00:05:38.296 --> 00:05:41.132
My goodness.
Where did he come from? He's so cute!

69
00:05:41.257 --> 00:05:42.842
How is it cute?

70
00:05:42.967 --> 00:05:44.594
It's really cute!

71
00:05:44.719 --> 00:05:46.637
It hurts!

72
00:05:46.763 --> 00:05:47.638
Damn it!

73
00:05:47.722 --> 00:05:49.599
Here. Come here.

74
00:05:52.351 --> 00:05:53.811
You ugly birdie!

75
00:05:54.228 --> 00:05:55.980
I'm going to fry you!

76
00:05:56.105 --> 00:05:58.316
I won't let you do that!

77
00:05:58.691 --> 00:06:00.735
Come to your senses!

78
00:06:01.235 --> 00:06:03.154
Didn't I tell you not to do that?

79
00:06:03.404 --> 00:06:06.824
Are you trying to tear down this building?

80
00:06:07.742 --> 00:06:09.660
-Sorry!
-Sorry!

81
00:06:10.203 --> 00:06:13.081
<i>You're clearly the one
who did the most damage!</i>

82
00:06:13.289 --> 00:06:15.875
All right. May I have your attention?

83
00:06:17.752 --> 00:06:19.962
It doesn't matter if the perpetrators
are royals or nobles.

84
00:06:20.046 --> 00:06:21.422
It's the same.

85
00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:23.508
We'll just leave it
to the Investigation Department.

86
00:06:23.633 --> 00:06:25.510
We'll just wait for the report.

87
00:06:25.885 --> 00:06:27.136
Enough said about that.

88
00:06:27.261 --> 00:06:29.180
I have some good news.

89
00:06:29.555 --> 00:06:30.890
-Good news?
-Good news?

90
00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:32.308
Would you like to know?

91
00:06:32.391 --> 00:06:33.601
Sure!

92
00:06:35.645 --> 00:06:39.816
Your performance has gained recognition
from the Magic Emperor.

93
00:06:39.941 --> 00:06:41.359
The Magic Emperor?

94
00:06:41.776 --> 00:06:44.737
So. you've been given a star.

95
00:06:46.072 --> 00:06:47.573
For real?

96
00:06:47.698 --> 00:06:49.742
Awesome!

97
00:06:49.992 --> 00:06:51.786
It's great!

98
00:06:51.911 --> 00:06:53.121
Not bad.

99
00:06:53.246 --> 00:06:54.831
Congratulations.

100
00:06:55.081 --> 00:06:57.583
Well. what do we do with the stars?

101
00:06:57.792 --> 00:06:59.794
Don't get all excited
if you don't know what it is.

102
00:06:59.919 --> 00:07:03.840
Stars are awarded by the Magic Emperor
based on performance.

103
00:07:03.965 --> 00:07:05.800
What are they for?

104
00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:08.678
This is like an honor.

105
00:07:08.803 --> 00:07:10.054
An honor?

106
00:07:10.179 --> 00:07:11.472
That's right. Asta.

107
00:07:11.597 --> 00:07:12.473
It's an honor.

108
00:07:12.682 --> 00:07:14.434
It's an honor for the men.

109
00:07:14.559 --> 00:07:16.102
There are girls here too.

110
00:07:16.227 --> 00:07:18.396
It's an honor for both men and women!

111
00:07:18.604 --> 00:07:20.148
I don't follow.

112
00:07:20.273 --> 00:07:24.277
The Magic Knights will compete
in terms of the number of stars earned.

113
00:07:24.735 --> 00:07:28.823
Because that shows
how much work a squad has done.

114
00:07:29.991 --> 00:07:31.701
I see!

115
00:07:32.952 --> 00:07:36.747
<i>Besides. Golden Dawn is currently
at the top with 70 stars.</i>

116
00:07:36.873 --> 00:07:38.082
<i>Seventy stars?</i>

117
00:07:38.749 --> 00:07:39.876
What about us?

118
00:07:40.001 --> 00:07:41.961
How many does the Black Bull have?

119
00:07:42.086 --> 00:07:44.464
We can't lose to the Golden Dawn!

120
00:07:46.007 --> 00:07:47.675
As for us...

121
00:07:55.641 --> 00:07:58.394
We'll have a negative 30 stars
with this added to the collection.

122
00:07:58.519 --> 00:07:59.395
Negative?

123
00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:00.646
What?

124
00:08:01.147 --> 00:08:03.816
We're 100 stars away from the Golden Dawn.

125
00:08:03.941 --> 00:08:05.485
One hundred?

126
00:08:06.986 --> 00:08:12.408
<i>It's a long way to go
to catch up to them. Yuno.</i>

127
00:08:12.617 --> 00:08:14.118
It's impossible.

128
00:08:15.453 --> 00:08:19.415
<i>Is it really a good idea for me
to continue staying in this squad?</i>

129
00:08:19.916 --> 00:08:21.542
Also. there's one more thing.

130
00:08:24.545 --> 00:08:26.172
It's the pay for this month.

131
00:08:29.926 --> 00:08:31.385
It's money!

132
00:08:31.511 --> 00:08:33.554
There are 200.000 <i>yuls</i>!

133
00:08:33.679 --> 00:08:34.889
Thank you!

134
00:08:35.264 --> 00:08:36.974
Thank you. Captain!

135
00:08:37.099 --> 00:08:39.894
That way.
I can eat a lot of delicious food!

136
00:08:40.019 --> 00:08:41.729
Sure. eat all you want.

137
00:08:41.896 --> 00:08:43.022
Hey. Captain!

138
00:08:43.147 --> 00:08:45.608
How much do I have to pay you
to get you to fight me?

139
00:08:45.733 --> 00:08:46.901
Name your price.

140
00:08:47.026 --> 00:08:48.152
No. thanks.

141
00:08:48.277 --> 00:08:50.071
Come on.

142
00:08:50.196 --> 00:08:55.117
I want to buy a new outfit for my goddess.
which is my sister. Marie.

143
00:08:55.243 --> 00:08:56.994
Which do you think suits her better?

144
00:08:57.119 --> 00:08:58.579
Don't ask me.

145
00:08:59.997 --> 00:09:01.123
I don't know.

146
00:09:01.541 --> 00:09:03.626
You get a day off tomorrow.

147
00:09:03.751 --> 00:09:05.336
Don't squander away all your money.

148
00:09:05.461 --> 00:09:08.089
I'm going on dates with the girls.

149
00:09:08.214 --> 00:09:09.590
As you wish.

150
00:09:11.425 --> 00:09:13.094
Thank you. Captain!

151
00:09:13.219 --> 00:09:15.638
Captain. thank you for looking out for us!

152
00:09:16.514 --> 00:09:18.849
I would like to hang out with you guys.

153
00:09:19.392 --> 00:09:21.394
What do you think?

154
00:09:21.519 --> 00:09:22.812
He's only giving us this much money.

155
00:09:22.937 --> 00:09:24.522
What nonsense is that?

156
00:09:24.647 --> 00:09:27.817
With this much money.
I can be ten years' worth of nomotatoes!

157
00:09:27.942 --> 00:09:28.943
Nomotatoes?

158
00:09:29.068 --> 00:09:30.069
What are those?

159
00:09:30.194 --> 00:09:32.863
<i>It is a kind of sweet potato
that is native to Hage Village</i>

160
00:09:32.989 --> 00:09:35.074
<i>which has an indescribable taste.</i>

161
00:09:35.324 --> 00:09:36.325
It sounds so gross.

162
00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:37.785
Not at all!

163
00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:40.913
Sister Lily can make anything taste good!

164
00:09:41.038 --> 00:09:42.164
Who's that?

165
00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:45.626
She's the one
I'm going to marry in the future!

166
00:09:45.751 --> 00:09:46.669
What?

167
00:09:46.836 --> 00:09:48.879
But aren't sisters part of the clergy?

168
00:09:49.171 --> 00:09:51.132
I don't think they can get married.

169
00:09:51.966 --> 00:09:53.301
There's always a way to go about it.

170
00:09:53.634 --> 00:09:55.177
I want to go beyond the limits!

171
00:09:55.469 --> 00:09:56.929
You're a fool!

172
00:09:57.179 --> 00:09:59.390
Congrats on getting your first pay!

173
00:10:00.099 --> 00:10:02.435
How are you going to spend it?

174
00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:03.811
I haven't thought about it.

175
00:10:03.936 --> 00:10:05.313
What about you. Little Boy?

176
00:10:05.438 --> 00:10:09.734
I want to send it back
to the church at Hage Village.

177
00:10:09.859 --> 00:10:12.153
I see. That's really good. Asta.

178
00:10:12.278 --> 00:10:13.362
That's what a real man is.

179
00:10:13.487 --> 00:10:14.572
You think so too?

180
00:10:14.697 --> 00:10:16.991
Magna. are you sending it back too?

181
00:10:17.116 --> 00:10:18.784
Of course.

182
00:10:18.868 --> 00:10:19.744
But...

183
00:10:19.869 --> 00:10:21.120
But?

184
00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.581
That will have to wait
until I've increased it a hundredfold.

185
00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:26.125
<i>This guy never learns.</i>

186
00:10:26.292 --> 00:10:29.337
If you are a real man. you have to gamble!

187
00:10:29.462 --> 00:10:32.173
Instead of a real man.
you should just call yourself a fool.

188
00:10:32.298 --> 00:10:35.259
It's good that you send it back.
but hopefully not all of it.

189
00:10:35.384 --> 00:10:37.762
Keep some for yourself.

190
00:10:37.845 --> 00:10:39.930
Really?

191
00:10:40.139 --> 00:10:42.933
But what should I spend it on?

192
00:10:43.059 --> 00:10:46.395
Let's go shopping
in the castle town tomorrow.

193
00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:47.730
You too.

194
00:10:49.482 --> 00:10:51.359
I'll take you there.

195
00:10:51.484 --> 00:10:52.902
-All right.
-All right.

196
00:10:59.659 --> 00:11:02.745
<i>Sister Lily. how are you?</i>

197
00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:04.538
<i>I'm doing great here.</i>

198
00:11:04.914 --> 00:11:08.042
<i>My seniors are taking great care of me.</i>

199
00:11:09.085 --> 00:11:11.379
Asta. stand right here.

200
00:11:11.504 --> 00:11:12.880
What for?

201
00:11:13.464 --> 00:11:14.799
Don't move around.

202
00:11:15.257 --> 00:11:17.009
Fire Magic!

203
00:11:19.553 --> 00:11:20.638
Exploding...

204
00:11:23.265 --> 00:11:27.937
Fireball!

205
00:11:28.729 --> 00:11:29.605
It's so hot!

206
00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:31.607
It's so hot!

207
00:11:31.732 --> 00:11:33.692
Didn't I tell you not to move around?

208
00:11:33.818 --> 00:11:35.569
I didn't move!

209
00:11:37.029 --> 00:11:40.241
<i>Also. I performed well
for my first mission...</i>

210
00:11:40.366 --> 00:11:44.578
<i>and gained a star from the Magic Emperor
for my performance.</i>

211
00:11:44.703 --> 00:11:50.334
<i>If this goes on. I might become
the Magic Emperor next month.</i>

212
00:11:50.459 --> 00:11:52.253
<i>I want to be the Magic Emperor</i>

213
00:11:52.336 --> 00:11:55.756
<i>and make this world
a happy place for everyone.</i>

214
00:11:55.881 --> 00:11:58.300
<i>Then. I'll come back for you.</i>

215
00:11:58.384 --> 00:11:59.927
<i>Please marry me!</i>

216
00:12:00.386 --> 00:12:04.140
Right. I'm sending back my first paycheck.

217
00:12:04.306 --> 00:12:05.349
Done!

218
00:12:05.724 --> 00:12:06.934
It's all done!

219
00:12:07.017 --> 00:12:09.645
I'm really good at writing letters!

220
00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:13.190
Sister Lily will surely be so touched
that she shed tears.

221
00:12:16.652 --> 00:12:18.070
<i>The Magic Emperor.</i>

222
00:12:18.571 --> 00:12:20.281
<i>The Magic Emperor?</i>

223
00:12:20.489 --> 00:12:23.075
<i>I wonder what kind of person he is.</i>

224
00:12:28.289 --> 00:12:30.666
Have you been to the castle town?

225
00:12:30.791 --> 00:12:32.918
-No.
-It makes sense.

226
00:12:33.002 --> 00:12:37.548
The royals or nobles rarely go
to places where commoners live.

227
00:12:37.756 --> 00:12:38.716
What about you. Little Boy?

228
00:12:38.841 --> 00:12:42.970
I merely passed by that place
to take the Magic Knights Entrance Exam.

229
00:12:43.137 --> 00:12:46.098
Well. enjoy yourself today.

230
00:12:46.223 --> 00:12:48.476
Come on! Don't simply touch around!

231
00:12:48.559 --> 00:12:49.727
What can I do?

232
00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:51.604
If I don't hold on tight.
I'm going to fall!

233
00:12:52.229 --> 00:12:56.317
<i>I just seem to care a lot. Damn it.</i>

234
00:12:57.109 --> 00:12:58.068
<i>Oh no.</i>

235
00:12:58.194 --> 00:13:00.279
<i>Not again?</i>

236
00:13:03.532 --> 00:13:05.075
<i>The Clover Kingdom</i>

237
00:13:05.242 --> 00:13:07.620
<i>is split between the Noble Realm.
where the royals and nobles live.</i>

238
00:13:07.745 --> 00:13:10.247
<i>Then. there's the Common Realm
where the commoners live.</i>

239
00:13:10.456 --> 00:13:13.042
<i>and the Forsaken Realm
where the lowly live.</i>

240
00:13:14.001 --> 00:13:17.421
<i>Kikka. the castle town
where Asta and Yuno participated...</i>

241
00:13:17.505 --> 00:13:20.508
<i>in the Magic Knights Entrance Exam
is in the Common Realm.</i>

242
00:13:26.889 --> 00:13:28.891
It's indeed very lively.

243
00:13:29.016 --> 00:13:30.684
It's so crowded.

244
00:13:38.651 --> 00:13:41.153
<i>I wish I could bring Sister Lily</i>

245
00:13:41.237 --> 00:13:43.489
<i>and the kids in the church here someday.</i>

246
00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:45.866
What about me?

247
00:13:50.621 --> 00:13:53.207
Marie. my goddess.

248
00:13:53.415 --> 00:13:54.959
I'm coming over now.

249
00:13:55.209 --> 00:13:57.002
I can't hold back anymore.

250
00:13:57.086 --> 00:13:59.797
I wish to see the smile on your face soon.

251
00:14:07.721 --> 00:14:09.139
Father!

252
00:14:09.557 --> 00:14:10.975
This voice...

253
00:14:16.021 --> 00:14:18.107
You're back again this month.

254
00:14:18.274 --> 00:14:19.733
Here I am again.

255
00:14:20.192 --> 00:14:22.403
I won't lose this time.

256
00:14:22.528 --> 00:14:23.988
So am I!

257
00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:27.867
Here's the super large serving
with everything on it!

258
00:14:28.075 --> 00:14:30.452
Let's see if you finish them all!

259
00:14:30.578 --> 00:14:32.663
I'm digging in!

260
00:14:38.002 --> 00:14:40.754
Just the sight of it
makes me want to throw up.

261
00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:47.303
Miss. are you free?

262
00:14:47.428 --> 00:14:49.638
Would you like to have a drink with me?

263
00:14:49.763 --> 00:14:51.557
Do I look like I'm free?

264
00:14:51.682 --> 00:14:53.934
You can bring your kids along.

265
00:14:54.393 --> 00:14:55.895
I know a great place--

266
00:14:56.020 --> 00:14:57.396
These aren't my kids!

267
00:14:57.521 --> 00:14:59.148
They are my siblings!

268
00:14:59.273 --> 00:15:01.609
We're rushing back to open the store.

269
00:15:01.734 --> 00:15:03.819
We don't have time for this!

270
00:15:05.905 --> 00:15:07.990
Tough women aren't that bad either.

271
00:15:10.826 --> 00:15:13.621
Miss. would you like to join me?

272
00:15:15.998 --> 00:15:17.958
Little boy. don't walk too fast
on your own!

273
00:15:18.083 --> 00:15:19.460
It makes me feel so excited!

274
00:15:19.585 --> 00:15:22.129
Are you really not going to buy anything?

275
00:15:23.047 --> 00:15:25.341
No. there are too many things!

276
00:15:25.424 --> 00:15:26.675
I don't know what to buy!

277
00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:28.344
Not for me.

278
00:15:29.345 --> 00:15:31.388
Hey. look at the robes.

279
00:15:31.472 --> 00:15:33.599
Aren't they the Magic Knights?

280
00:15:34.934 --> 00:15:36.352
That symbol...

281
00:15:36.477 --> 00:15:38.854
Seriously? The Black Bull?

282
00:15:38.979 --> 00:15:42.274
That's Vanessa. the Drunken Frenzy Witch.

283
00:15:42.399 --> 00:15:45.819
Are that cute girl and that little brat
the members of the Black Bull too?

284
00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:48.822
It's better for us to stay away from them.

285
00:15:49.073 --> 00:15:51.325
What's with the noises all of a sudden?

286
00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:53.035
Ignore them.

287
00:15:53.285 --> 00:15:56.705
As long as there are Magic Knights.
it helps to curb crime.

288
00:15:56.997 --> 00:16:00.876
Besides. some nice guys
might come approaching us.

289
00:16:05.005 --> 00:16:08.050
<i>We've bought the healing herbs</i>

290
00:16:08.175 --> 00:16:10.803
<i>and the shique ointment for disinfection.</i>

291
00:16:11.345 --> 00:16:13.514
<i>That's all for now.</i>

292
00:16:15.099 --> 00:16:16.934
We've got what we needed.

293
00:16:17.017 --> 00:16:19.269
Let's go somewhere quiet.

294
00:16:19.395 --> 00:16:20.938
Somewhere quiet?

295
00:16:21.313 --> 00:16:23.399
It's my personal collection.

296
00:16:25.567 --> 00:16:26.777
This is it!

297
00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:28.028
Here?

298
00:16:28.153 --> 00:16:29.905
But it's just a small alley.

299
00:16:36.328 --> 00:16:37.871
It's a dead end.

300
00:16:40.624 --> 00:16:41.667
What?

301
00:16:42.835 --> 00:16:44.253
All right! Quickly come over!

302
00:16:48.298 --> 00:16:50.467
That was close.

303
00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:54.346
{\an8}BLACK MARKET

304
00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:56.390
{\an8}This is the Black Market.

305
00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.851
{\an8}The Black Market?

306
00:17:00.811 --> 00:17:03.063
This place is a little dangerous.

307
00:17:03.147 --> 00:17:06.942
but it has great magic tools
that are super effective.

308
00:17:07.735 --> 00:17:09.069
Hey. Vanessa.

309
00:17:09.153 --> 00:17:10.571
I've brought in some good stuff.

310
00:17:10.696 --> 00:17:13.365
Awesome. Show me later.

311
00:17:13.449 --> 00:17:15.117
This is so awesome!

312
00:17:16.368 --> 00:17:19.121
What's wrong?
You don't seem to be interested.

313
00:17:19.329 --> 00:17:20.289
No.

314
00:17:20.414 --> 00:17:22.041
But it's no surprise.

315
00:17:22.416 --> 00:17:25.878
because the royals and nobles
wouldn't come to places like this.

316
00:17:27.087 --> 00:17:31.800
But you still can't control
your magic. right?

317
00:17:32.009 --> 00:17:34.636
That's right. But how are these related?

318
00:17:34.762 --> 00:17:38.223
There might be a magic tool in the market
that will help you control your magic.

319
00:17:40.392 --> 00:17:44.521
As long as you can find
the magic tool that suits you.

320
00:17:44.605 --> 00:17:47.357
you might be able to control it.

321
00:17:47.566 --> 00:17:49.651
Control my magic power?

322
00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:52.571
Let's try to find it. All right?

323
00:17:52.863 --> 00:17:54.364
Sure!

324
00:17:55.491 --> 00:17:57.826
Why is it so lively over there?

325
00:17:57.951 --> 00:18:01.163
It's still too soon for you to go there.

326
00:18:01.538 --> 00:18:05.000
If amateurs aren't careful in there.
they might get screwed over.

327
00:18:06.168 --> 00:18:07.336
All right!

328
00:18:07.544 --> 00:18:09.630
Here I come!

329
00:18:09.713 --> 00:18:12.508
I'll use my paycheck
and increase it a hundredfold!

330
00:18:12.633 --> 00:18:14.760
<i>I met someone I know!</i>

331
00:18:17.262 --> 00:18:19.890
Damn it! I lose again!

332
00:18:22.267 --> 00:18:25.521
That's because I can see the future.

333
00:18:26.855 --> 00:18:29.066
That old lady is really good.

334
00:18:29.858 --> 00:18:33.070
Anyway. it's not the time for this now.

335
00:18:33.529 --> 00:18:34.947
I should get back to work.

336
00:18:35.489 --> 00:18:37.449
They called it a job.

337
00:18:37.533 --> 00:18:39.952
but it's actually
to catch the pickpockets.

338
00:18:40.244 --> 00:18:43.247
Is this something
that the Magic Knights should do?

339
00:18:45.791 --> 00:18:48.127
But the captain is so scary.

340
00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:50.170
I dare not disobey him.

341
00:18:51.547 --> 00:18:53.298
Kiddo. do you have any objections?

342
00:18:53.423 --> 00:18:56.135
Beware. I'll cut you into two!

343
00:18:58.303 --> 00:19:01.598
I finally made it into the Magic Knights.
but it feels so miserable.

344
00:19:01.723 --> 00:19:04.476
It's the Green Mantis.

345
00:19:05.102 --> 00:19:06.645
It's a mantis.

346
00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:08.522
A bug.

347
00:19:08.897 --> 00:19:11.441
I have to work my ass off
every single day.

348
00:19:11.692 --> 00:19:14.903
Even if I go on a mission.
I've to risk my life to be a bait.

349
00:19:15.362 --> 00:19:17.906
I get constipation
and going bald because of that.

350
00:19:18.782 --> 00:19:20.200
Damn it.

351
00:19:22.828 --> 00:19:24.037
She's so cute!

352
00:19:24.538 --> 00:19:26.290
How about this?

353
00:19:26.415 --> 00:19:29.668
It looks like it can be used
to stabilize your magic power.

354
00:19:30.586 --> 00:19:31.879
It looks awful.

355
00:19:32.337 --> 00:19:34.631
Don't say that. Try it on first.

356
00:19:48.228 --> 00:19:51.190
It's your fault for standing there!

357
00:19:52.524 --> 00:19:54.818
I didn't expect to see you here!

358
00:19:54.943 --> 00:19:56.278
What's the matter?

359
00:19:57.112 --> 00:20:01.909
The Black Market doesn't seem
like a place for pretty girls like you.

360
00:20:03.118 --> 00:20:04.578
Are you lost?

361
00:20:04.953 --> 00:20:09.958
Allow me. the elite members
of the Magic Knights. to lead you outside.

362
00:20:10.125 --> 00:20:12.002
Get lost. you flying insect.

363
00:20:14.546 --> 00:20:18.884
Hey! I found an interesting item!

364
00:20:19.051 --> 00:20:21.762
Don't tell me you're buying that!

365
00:20:21.887 --> 00:20:23.222
It can talk!

366
00:20:23.347 --> 00:20:24.306
He bought it.

367
00:20:24.431 --> 00:20:25.265
Look!

368
00:20:25.349 --> 00:20:26.934
<i>We are humans!</i>

369
00:20:27.059 --> 00:20:28.310
Right?

370
00:20:28.852 --> 00:20:30.604
So what?

371
00:20:32.439 --> 00:20:34.316
<i>This little brat...</i>

372
00:20:34.816 --> 00:20:37.236
Wait. Aren't you Haha?

373
00:20:37.361 --> 00:20:38.987
I'm Sekke! Not Haha!

374
00:20:39.112 --> 00:20:40.948
Haha. how have you been?

375
00:20:41.073 --> 00:20:42.574
I told you! I'm Haha...

376
00:20:42.658 --> 00:20:44.159
No. I mean. Sekke!

377
00:20:44.868 --> 00:20:45.994
Who is he?

378
00:20:46.286 --> 00:20:48.580
Someone I met at the entrance exam.

379
00:20:49.164 --> 00:20:51.375
I see. He's a member of the Green Mantis.

380
00:20:51.667 --> 00:20:55.170
<i>Are these two pretty ladies with him?</i>

381
00:20:55.295 --> 00:20:56.421
<i>If so.</i>

382
00:20:56.546 --> 00:20:59.216
<i>these two must be members
of the Black Bull.</i>

383
00:20:59.466 --> 00:21:00.801
<i>Asta. you bastard.</i>

384
00:21:00.884 --> 00:21:03.720
<i>Despite being in the Black Bull.
you're making me jealous.</i>

385
00:21:04.304 --> 00:21:05.514
<i>Come to think of it.</i>

386
00:21:05.639 --> 00:21:10.310
<i>it's all your fault that I ended up
in the Green Mantis.</i>

387
00:21:12.437 --> 00:21:14.273
<i>How infuriating.</i>

388
00:21:23.782 --> 00:21:25.867
Thief!

389
00:21:25.993 --> 00:21:28.245
My winning prize!

390
00:21:28.495 --> 00:21:30.747
Stop right there!

391
00:23:05.634 --> 00:23:08.095
<i>-Petite Clover!
-Petite Clover!</i>

392
00:23:09.554 --> 00:23:12.057
<i>Sekke's Haha Lecture!</i>

393
00:23:13.058 --> 00:23:14.059
"Haha!"

394
00:23:14.351 --> 00:23:16.311
-"Haha!"
-No. that's not right.

395
00:23:16.436 --> 00:23:17.562
"Haha!"

396
00:23:17.938 --> 00:23:19.231
"Haha!"

397
00:23:19.481 --> 00:23:23.193
You're still far
from that level of "Haha".

398
00:23:23.318 --> 00:23:24.486
"Haha!"

399
00:23:24.611 --> 00:23:25.862
What's "Haha"?

400
00:23:30.033 --> 00:23:31.785
<i>Here comes the chance
to do a deed of merit!</i>

401
00:23:31.910 --> 00:23:35.747
<i>I want to catch the pickpocket
and gain stars from the Magic Emperor.</i>

402
00:23:36.081 --> 00:23:38.041
Black Clover. <i>Page 12.</i>

403
00:23:38.166 --> 00:23:40.001
<i>"The Magic Emperor Saw."</i>

404
00:23:40.127 --> 00:23:41.920
<i>My "Haha" is in never giving up!</i>

405
00:23:42.003 --> 00:23:43.296
Subtitle translation by Angel Choo

405
00:23:44.305 --> 00:24:44.199
